SOLUTION 1 Pure water
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge

SOLUTION 2
    temp 20
    C(4) 0.05 mol/kgw as C
    pH 7 charge

SOLUTION 3
    temp 20
    Ca 0.05 mol/kgw
    pH 7 charge

MIX 10
    1 0.5
    2 0.25
    3 0.25

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 10
    Calcite 0 0

REACTION_TEMPERATURE 10
    20 200 in 10 steps

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -temperature true
    -ionic_strength true
    -simulation true

END